  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deferred and Performance Based Maintenance Dredging of the Odaw Channel and Korle Lagoon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It concerns a deferred and routine maintenance dredging project under a Performance Based Contracting (PBC) approach project in the Odaw River Basin in Accra (Ghana). The dredging works in the Odaw River Basin will be combined with the re-use and environmentally-safe disposal of the dredged material. The project will be part of the preparations for the Greater Accra Resilient Integrated Development (GARD) programme from the World Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
